{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"NUM","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"民數記","commonName":"民數記","title":"民數記","order":4,"numberOfChapters":36,"sha256":"7c111f07a9bd9423759abb7c8e169e1e99ed2bf1c6e109dc17b097e7eec739cf","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/1.json","lastChapterNumber":36,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/36.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1272},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["亞倫的杖"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華對摩西說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「你曉諭以色列人，從他們手下取杖，每支派一根；從他們所有的首領，按着支派，共取十二根。你要將各人的名字寫在各人的杖上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["並要將亞倫的名字寫在利未的杖上，因為各族長必有一根杖。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["你要把這些杖存在會幕內法櫃前，就是我與你們相會之處。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["後來我所揀選的那人，他的杖必發芽。這樣，我必使以色列人向你們所發的怨言止息，不再達到我耳中。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["於是摩西曉諭以色列人，他們的首領就把杖交給他，按着支派，每首領一根，共有十二根；亞倫的杖也在其中。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["摩西就把杖存在法櫃的帳幕內，在耶和華面前。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["第二天，摩西進法櫃的帳幕去。誰知利未族亞倫的杖已經發了芽，生了花苞，開了花，結了熟杏。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["摩西就把所有的杖從耶和華面前拿出來，給以色列眾人看；他們看見了，各首領就把自己的杖拿去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和華吩咐摩西說：「把亞倫的杖還放在法櫃前，給這些背叛之子留作記號。這樣，你就使他們向我發的怨言止息，免得他們死亡。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["摩西就這樣行。耶和華怎樣吩咐他，他就怎樣行了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["以色列人對摩西說：「我們死啦！我們滅亡啦！都滅亡啦！"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["凡挨近耶和華帳幕的是必死的。我們都要死亡嗎？」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/NUM/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}